OL,3,GNEWSAIsles of Scilly ferry on emotional
OL,4,Afinal voyage
OL,5,
OL,6,FPassengers aboard the final sailing of
OL,7,Fthe Scillonian III have described the
OL,8,Fjourney as the end of an era, as the
OL,9,Ficonic ferry completed its last voyage
OL,10,Fbetween Cornwall and the Isles of
OL,11,FScilly after 49 years of service.
OL,13,FAmong more than 480 passengers on board
OL,14,Fwas Julian Fry, from west Devon, who
OL,15,Fhas been travelling on the vessel since
OL,16,F1977.
OL,18,F"It is a sad day to see her go," he
OL,19,Fsaid. "She's part of Scilly, she's like
OL,20,Fone of the islands of Scilly. She opens
OL,21,Fdoors to holidays and happy memories
OL,22,Fand she's a vital lifeline."
OL,23,APub: 08-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
