OL,3,GNEWSAIsles of Scilly ferry on emotional
OL,4,Afinal voyage
OL,5,
OL,6,FThere was a celebratory atmosphere on
OL,7,Fboard, with gig rowers sending off the
OL,8,Fferry at St Mary's harbour and a
OL,9,Fmusical reception by the Cape Cornwall
OL,10,FSingers in Penzance.
